abstract: >-
  An intelligent autoscaling system that uses Large Language Models (LLMs) as a
  reasoning layer for Kubernetes workload prediction and cluster status to improve
  scaling decisions. The system integrates OpenAPI-compatible LLM interfaces,
  multi-agent reasoning, and deterministic safety policies.